/_bmad/*

# Project-local Codex skills generated by the BMAD installer.
/.agents/skills/bmad-*/

# Intentionally keep AGENTS.md and _bmad-output/ planning artifacts trackable.

# Claude Code skills generated by the BMAD installer in cloud sessions.
/.claude/skills/bmad-*/
